l Health Grants to Five Community Organizations', 'text': "EDEN PRAIRIE, MINN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--OPTUM, A LEADING HEALTH SERVICES COMPANY AND PART OF UNITEDHEALTH GROUP (NYSE: UNH), HAS AWARDED $1.4 MILLION IN MATERNAL HEALTH GRANTS AND WILL PROVIDE PRO BONO SERVICES TO FIVE COMMUNITY ORGANIZATIONS AIMED AT IMPROVING MATERNAL HEALTH OUTCOMES AND INCREASING HEALTH CARE ACCESS FOR UNDERSERVED POPULATIONS. “OPTUM IS COMMITTED TO ADDRESSING THE NATION'S MATERNAL HEALTH CRISIS, WHICH IS HAVING A SIGNIFICANT IMPACT ON UNDERSERVED AND VULNERABLE POPULATIONS,”"}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2021-07-01 09:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Over 78 million Verizon customers protected from over 13 billion unwanted calls', 'text': 'BUILDING ON EFFORTS TO DATE, VERIZON CERTIFIES WITH FCC THAT TRAFFIC IS SIGNED WITH STIR/SHAKEN CALLER ID AUTHENTICATION PROTOCOLS BUILDING ON EFFORTS TO DATE, VERIZON CERTIFIES WITH FCC THAT TRAFFIC IS SIGNED WITH STIR/SHAKEN CALLER ID AUTHENTICATION PROTOCOLS'}{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2021-07-01 21:45:00-04:56', 'title': 'Walmart Wraps Annual Open Call Event, 167 Products to Advance, 705 to Receive Further Consideration', 'text': "BENTONVILLE, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--OPEN CALL 2021 IS NOW IN THE BOOKS WITH MORE THAN 900 SMALL BUSINESSES FROM ACROSS THE COUNTRY PITCHING THEIR PRODUCTS MADE, GROWN OR ASSEMBLED IN THE U.S. TO WALMART AND SAM'S CLUB MERCHANTS TODAY. AS EXPECTED, THIS YEAR'S COHORT MARKED THE LARGEST NUMBER OF BUSINESS OWNERS EVER TO TAKE PART IN THE ONE-DAY EVENT, REPRESENTING ALL 50 STATES, THE DISTRICT OF COLUMBIA AND PUERTO RICO. OF THOSE BUSINESSES, 167 OF THEIR PRODUCTS ARE ADVANCING TO THE NEXT STAGE IN"}{'symbol': 'WMB', 'date': '2021-07-01 09:36:00-04:56', 'title': 'Williams Completes Acquisition of Sequent Energy Management', 'text': 'TULSA, OKLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WILLIAMS COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF SEQUENT ENERGY MANAGEMENT'}{'symbol': 'WLTW', 'date': '2021-07-01 03:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Energy transition for power sector creating new risks says Willis Towers Watson Review', 'text': '2021 POWER MARKET REVIEW “ADAPTING TO NEW REALITIES” OUTLINES THE CHALLENGES FACING THE POWER MARKET AS IT EMBRACES THE ENERGY TRANSITION 2021 POWER MARKET REVIEW “ADAPTING TO NEW REALITIES” OUTLINES THE CHALLENGES FACING THE POWER MARKET AS IT EMBRACES THE ENERGY TRANSITION'}